1. The Property (Padding vs. Margin)
  p = Padding: Space inside the element (pushes content away from the edges).
  m = Margin: Space outside the element (pushes the whole element away from other things).

2. The Direction
The second letter tells Tailwind exactly where to put that space:
Letter   |   Meaning   |   Axis/Direction   |   Example
x            x-axis             Left & Right     px-4
y            y-axis          Top & Bottom        py-4
t             Top      Top only                  mt-4
b            Bottom    Bottom only               pb-4
l            Left      Left only                 ml-4
r           Right      Right only                pr-4
(none)    All sides      Top, Bottom,            p-4
                  
                  Left,
                  Right
